  "result": "I made the changes for all four reports. Typecheck is clean and the vitest suite passes (73 files, 617 tests). I did not add new tests for these paths.\n\nChanges:\n- **New `src/server/services/_references.ts`**: checks for current members, the workspace's own labels, live same-project parent issues, and live top-level parent comments on the same issue. Each throws `NotFoundError`.\n- **`issue-service.ts`**: create and update validate labels, create validates the assignee and parent, and assign validates the assignee. All of this runs before any write.\n- **`project-service.ts`**: create and update validate the lead as a current member.\n- **`comment-service.ts`**: reply targets are validated before the rate-limit charge and insert. Composer-supplied mentions are kept only if they are current members, so non-members are dropped and not notified.\n- **`label-repository.ts`**: `listLabelsForIssues` also filters the label join by `orgId`, so an issue never shows a label outside its workspace.",
